SUMMARY:Freedom Sings\, A Benefit for Peace and Justice Center
DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission \nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird17 at checkout. Offer ends May 17th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nAn evening of music in support of freedom\, unity and peace.\nThe “protest song” has deep roots in this country going back to the birth of our nation. Musicians have lead the way\, inspiring us\, awakening us and challenging the norm.\nLet Freedom Sing \nFeaturing performances by:\nHilary Marckx and Christiane Swartz\nCori Wood\nAndre DeChannes\nZoe Samanth with Paul Henry and Lindsey McFarland\nKevin Hutchinson\, Ann Hutchinson and Brian Carlisle\nJan Kahdeman \nkevinhutchinsonmusic.com\nhttps://www.facebook.com/HilaryMarckxSingerSongwriter\nhttps://www.instagram.com/babyhummingbirdproductions\nhttps://andredechannes.com/ \nBenefitting the Peace & Justice Center of Sonoma County
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/freedom-sings-a-benefit-for-peace-and-justice-center/
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa\, 576 Ross Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
