SUMMARY:The Sonoma Shakers at the Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:If you’re looking for the ultimate dance band for your Sonoma County event\, look no further than the Sonoma Shakers\, ready to make your event extraordinary. The Sonoma Shakers guarantee a night of music that will have you and your guests shaking in your shoes with their wide repertoire ranging from heartfelt Blues to thrilling Rock favorites. Their contagious rhythms and fascinating performances create an environment that inspires everyone to get up and dance. The Sonoma Shakers are more than simply a band; they’re a formula for an unforgettable evening. You’re not just receiving music when you hire them; you’re getting a soul-stirring trip through the core of Sonoma’s musical tradition. \n 
