SUMMARY:The Alamo Mission Band at Brewsters
DESCRIPTION:Welcome! You’ve found Alamo Mission Band\, a group that captivates and energizes audiences with a soulful and energetic blend of sounds inspiried and influenced by the legendary Jerry Garcia Band. With several years of combined experience on large and small stages from East coast to West\, our music features seamless harmonies\, tight musicianship\, and powerhouse female vocals that will move you. Join us on a musical journey inspired by artists like Jerry Garcia\, Jimmy Cliff\, Bob Dylan\, Van Morrison\, Leon Russell\, and more that are as vibrant and diverse as the American landscape itself. \n 
