SUMMARY:Blu DeTiger at Lagunitas
DESCRIPTION:Blu DeTiger is a renowned bassist\, singer\, and songwriter who has quickly become a prominent figure in the modern music scene. Her journey began at the age of 7 when she first picked up the bass guitar\, and she has since developed a unique sound that blends funk\, pop\, rock\, and electronic music. Blu’s rise to fame was fueled by her electrifying performances and viral videos on social media\, where her skillful bass playing and infectious energy captivated a global audience. In 2021\, Blu released her debut EP How Did We Get Here? which garnered critical acclaim and solidified her status as a rising star. She has had a slew of notable collaborations with the likes of Chromeo\, Caroline Polachek\, and Bleachers and has stamped her name within the same space as some of her most notable peers. \nIn 2024\, Blu debuted her first studio album titled All I Ever Want Is Everything hosting features from the likes of Mallrat and Magdalena Bay\, as well as co-writes from esteemed artists such as Chappell Roan\, Uffie\, Mayer Hawthorne\, Alexander 23 and brother and frequent collaborator\, Rex. All I Want Is Everything further expands the growth of Blu’s signature funk\, pop\, and disco fusion and led her on a headline tour across the world. She also performed at major festivals such as Lollapalooza and Bonnaroo and has received recognition and high praises from notable media including Rolling Stone\, NME\, Billboard\, PEOPLE\, MTV\, Forbes\, NYLON\, ELLE\, and more. She was also featured on the cover of Forbes 30 Under 30 music list and has made appearances on shows like Saturday Night Live and Late Night with Seth Meyers.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/blu-detiger-at-lagunitas/
LOCATION:Lagunitas Petaluma Taproom\, 1280 N McDowell Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.27189;-122.663158
